.SH CUSTOM INPUT FOR EACH DEVICE
By adding a variable with the same name as a device name followed by the
_input_gain suffix, the script will use that input gain instead of the
value in \f[B]input_gain\f[R].
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Note: if the device name contains \(lq.\(rq or \(lq\-\(rq, these
characters need to be replaced with \(lq_\(rq to work.
